    {
      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "A Catholic devotion of prayer repeated over nine days. Dictee names it directly in its prologue: \"NOVENA: NINE EACH. THE RECITATION OR PRAYER AND PRACTICING OF DEVOTIONS DURING A NINE DAY PERIOD / And it begins\" (p. 19). The work frames its nine chapters, each placed under a Muse, as such a sequence of invocations.",
